TEXT 536 200 Left 2 !.tran {Tstop}
TEXT 248 248 Left 2 !.param fs 200k\n.param Ts =1/fs\n.step param Duty list 0.3 0.345 0.4 0.5;.param Duty 0.345 ;\n.param Ton1 Duty*Ts\n.param Ton2 Ts-Ton1\n.param Tr 1n\n.param Tf 1n\n.param Tstart 9m\n.param Tstop 20m\n.param Tdel=50n
TEXT 256 528 Left 2 !.model MyDiode D(Ron=0.001 Roff=100Meg Vfwd=0)\n.model MySwitch SW (Ron=0.001 Roff=100Meg Vt=1)\n.model LED D(IS=1E-15 N=3.48 RS=0.5)
TEXT 1064 408 Left 2 !.meas TRAN P_in AVG -V(Vi)*I(V1) FROM 9.5m TO {Tstop}
TEXT 1064 456 Left 2 !.meas TRAN P_out AVG V(Vo)*I(D3) FROM 9.5m TO {Tstop}
TEXT 1064 504 Left 2 !.meas Efficienza param P_out/P_in
